of.  Tucked on a quiet, tree-lined street, you're steps from Griesbach's parks, pathways, and tight-knit community feel, with quick access to Anthony Henday Drive and 97 Street for an easy commute anywhere in the city.  A rare chance to own a piece of Griesbach's character with the hard work already done. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$399,900"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","4"],["Bathrooms","1"],["Living area","1,323 sq ft"],["Lot size","3,920 sq ft"],["Year built","1951"],["Storeys","2"],["Neighbourhood","Griesbach"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5E6L8"],["MLS® number","E4505426"],["Listed","August 25, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Stove, Dryer, Garage door opener, Garage door opener remote(s)"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Basement","Unfinished, Full"],["Parking","Detached Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","5.07 m × 3.55 m (16'8\" × 11'8\")"],["Dining room","Main level","3.63 m × 3.56 m (11'11\" × 11'8\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","4.04 m × 3.59 m (13'3\" × 11'9\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","3.32 m × 3.61 m (10'11\" × 11'10\")"],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level","2.23 m × 3.58 m (7'4\" × 11'9\")"],["Bedroom 3","Upper Level","2.92 m × 2.57 m (9'7\" × 8'5\")"],["Bedroom 4","Upper Level","2.62 m × 3.59 m (8'7\" × 11'9\")"]],"courtesy":"Jennifer O'Connor, Vita Nova Realty & Management","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"griesbach","area":"northwest-edmonton"}